<title>JAPAN: Oi Electric - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Oi Electric - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 12.73		vs	   12.98</p>
<p> Operating	  441    mln	  vs	  167    mln</p>
<p> Current	    586    mln	  vs	  508    mln</p>
<p> Net		  369    mln	  vs	  345    mln</p>
